# Programming Assignment_1  ==>  Preparing to Model

This assignment focuses on exploring and understanding a vehicle fuel dataset using Python. It uses Pandas for data analysis and Matplotlib and Seaborn for visualization.

The completed parts cover:
- Calculating the mean and median of numerical attributes.
- Checking missing values and data quality.
- Using box plots to identify potential outliers and understand data distributions.
- Interpreting statistical results and visualizations.

The goal is to understand the dataset and prepare it for further machine learning analysis.
